TI  - FSL-SAGE: Accelerating Federated Split Learning via Smashed Activation Gradient Estimation
AU  - Nair, Srijith
AU  - Lin, Michael
AU  - Ju, Peizhong
AU  - Talebi, Amirreza
AU  - Bentley, Elizabeth Serena
